  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Aqua Farms Organization</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project is needed to alleviate the current shortage of fish in and around Dar es Salaam. Using modern fish breeding technology, the project will operate a modern fish hatchery to breed and supply fish fingerlings to fish farmers in Tanzania. Increased fish consumption will enhance the nutritive value of food and in particular the rate of protein intake.</narrative>
  </description>
